# Generated synthetic source data (Parquet). Regenerable via
# `python scripts/generate_data.py` against seed 42 — not tracked in git,
# since the portfolio profile alone is millions of rows. Each profile's
# manifest.json (row counts, file hashes, injected issue codes/rates) is
# small and IS tracked, so the intended output stays documented.
data/incoming/*/customers/
data/incoming/*/orders/
data/incoming/*/payments/
